  "transformations": [
    "raw/ holds the API bars unmodified (all hours), one minute file per calendar month.",
    "minute/<date>.csv keeps bars whose start is in [session open, session close) per the XNYS calendar, so pre-market and after-hours bars are excluded; prices are not altered.",
    "No gaps are filled and no bars are interpolated. Missing minutes are reported, not repaired.",
    "A session is unusable if it has no regular-session bars, fails structural checks, or has no daily bar; unusable sessions are kept on disk but never fed to the engine."
